{
  "job_B2.2.8_20251003_114504": {
    "chunk_text": "or\u00f0e se tiligende on rihtlicre til\u00f0e. Se \u00f0e w\u00e6re slapol, weor\u00f0e se ful wacor, & se \u00f0e w\u00e6re full slaw, weor\u00f0e se unslaw to cyrican gelome Se \u00f0e w\u00e6re leassagol, weor\u00f0e se so\u00f0sagol. Se \u00f0e w\u00e6re b\u00e6cslitol, weor\u00f0e se w\u00e6rsagol. Se \u00f0e w\u00e6re stuntwyrde, weor\u00f0e se wiswyrde. And se \u00f0e on unriht abysgode hine sylfne, se on halgum gebedum abysgie hine symle. And se \u00f0e w\u00e6re ungeleafful rihtes geleafan, weor\u00f0e se geleafful godcundes rihtes. \u00d0us man sceal \u00e6lc unriht mid rihte gebetan & unweod aweodian & god s\u00e6d ar\u00e6ran. Nu la, leofan men, gelyfa\u00f0 huru georne & anr\u00e6dlice be\u00feenca\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t annes & \u00f0rynnes on godcundnesse Ealle \u00fea \u00f0ry naman befeh\u00f0 an godcund miht & is untod\u00e6led an ece God, wealdend & wyrhta ealra Se is to lufianne & to weor\u00f0ianne ofer ealle o\u00f0re \u00f0ing. And riht is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc cristen man eac o\u00f0erne lufie & healde mid rihte, & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig o\u00f0rum ne beode Ne \u00e6nig ne syrwe ne o\u00f0rum ne swicie, ac healde \u00e6lc o\u00f0erne mid rihtre getryw\u00f0e. Ic l\u00e6re eac georne manna gehwylcne \u00fe\u00e6t he Godes ege h\u00e6bbe \u00e6fre on gemynde & Godes hus symle Sibbe & some lufie man georne & \u00e6lc fracodlic facn \u00e6fre aweorpe & \u00e6ghwyl",
